---
title: Order lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Placed: checkout
  Placed --> Paid: payment authorized
  Placed --> Cancelled: payment declined
  Paid --> Shipped: courier pickup
  Paid --> Cancelled: customer cancels
  Shipped --> Delivered
  Shipped --> Returned: return requested
  Delivered --> [*]
  Returned --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
